  "title": "Lock with a green light for codes 12, 15 and a red light for codes 1, 3, 8, 14",
  "spec": "A lock with 4 switches a, b, c, d (a is the biggest digit of the binary number): the green light turns on only for the numbers 12 or 15, the red light turns on only for the numbers 1, 3, 8 or 14, and for every other number both lights stay off.",
