   "t": 26.08,
   "type": "plan",
   "parts": [
    "lock_indicator"
   ],
   "definition_of_done": [
    "All 16 possible input combinations (a,b,c,d) produce the correct green and red outputs",
    "Green output is 1 iff input is decimal 12 (1100) or 15 (1111); otherwise 0",
    "Red output is 1 iff input is decimal 1 (0001), 3 (0011), 8 (1000), or 14 (1110); otherwise 0",
    "Green and red outputs are never both 1 for the same input",
    "For all other inputs (0,2,4,5,6,7,9,10,11,13), both green and red are 0",
    "All used gates are only AND, OR, XOR, or NOT; NOT has exactly 1 input; AND/OR/XOR have exactly 2 inputs",
    "Every gate has a unique name and a single output signal",
    "Every output signal maps to a real output port (green, red) and is driven by at least one gate",
    "No gate output is left completely unused (unconnected)",
    "No signal fan-out exceeds 4 gate inputs across the design",
    "Input ports are exactly a, b, c, d; output ports are exactly green, red"
   ]
